%% profile: ml-pipeline
flowchart LR
    raw[(Submitted diploma archive)] --> ingest[Extract safe project copy]
    ingest --> validate{Detect document type}
    validate -->|valid| extract[Parse sections and figures]
    extract --> clean[Normalize layout features]
    clean --> split[Build review batches]
    split --> features[Compute style metrics]
    features --> train[Score formatting risks]
    train --> eval{Review threshold}
    eval -->|accepted| registry[(Report artifact)]
    registry --> deploy[Publish result]
